<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC News</title><subtitle type="html">BBC News - Technology</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/news/technology/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:25:06Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/technology" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/news/technology/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>New Indian mega library rocked by scandal over 'AI-generated books'</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c54gne3plvrxo#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:25:06Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T11:33:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c54gne3plvrxo--f2638f7d630e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c54gne3plvrxo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The Tamil Nadu government has ordered an internal audit of library collections across the state.</summary></entry><entry><title>What we know so far about Jensen Huang's affair with suspected Chinese spy</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckgel338xql3o#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T07:44:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckgel338xql3o--e869dd4c2eff.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ckgel338xql3o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The billionaire tech executive finds himself mired in a personal and national security scandal.</summary></entry><entry><title>Robot vessels take on the dangerous work of mine hunting</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj5yn24llxd6o#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-11T00:19:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj5yn24llxd6o--b2f23fe60f3a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj5yn24llxd6o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The conflict in the Gulf is an opportunity for the US to test its autonomous mine-hunting systems.</summary></entry><entry><title>Nvidia hires major US law firm to investigate alleged Chinese spy affair</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck1wvwwl3x0go#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T22:52:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck1wvwwl3x0go--9435eb245211.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/ck1wvwwl3x0go?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The appointment was made after it emerged Jensen Huang had an affair with a woman believed to be a spy for China.</summary></entry><entry><title>Claude chatbot maker set for $1.3tn stock market debut despite 'catastrophic' AI warning</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crpdgd723x2zo#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T17:56:12Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crpdgd723x2zo--c67f8109386f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/crpdgd723x2zo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The AI company behind the Claude chatbot will offer its shares at between $70 and $78, which is lower than what was expected.</summary></entry><entry><title>Faisal Islam: What the boss of US tech giant Nvidia told me about China and national security</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c64g1gzy2vdzo#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T09:23:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c64g1gzy2vdzo--9d5d87a4a477.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c64g1gzy2vdzo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Huang, who is now being investigated over an affair with an alleged Chinese spy, is far more important to the future of the world order than other tech bosses.</summary></entry><entry><title>Trump says FBI investigating Nvidia boss's affair with alleged Chinese spy</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqg7x7dpvym8o#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T08:23:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqg7x7dpvym8o--4a9293f6fb18.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqg7x7dpvym8o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The US president said he spoke with Jensen Huang on Monday and asked him about the affair with the alleged spy.</summary></entry><entry><title>Australia considers criminal penalties for rogue AI in wake of OpenAI hack</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmp3g37l566po#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-10T05:22:39Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmp3g37l566po--d4036d1f11fe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmp3g37l566po?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">AI safety regulator will also be created after a rogue OpenAI agent hacked government websites.</summary></entry><entry><title>Zoe Kleinman: Nvidia CEO's affair will cause ripples across US and beyond</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj3vqv3nee72o#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T21:52:28Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj3vqv3nee72o--a4177bf4c675.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj3vqv3nee72o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Jensen Huang is being investigated by his own company over an extramarital affair with a woman alleged to be a Chinese spy.</summary></entry><entry><title>Nvidia shares tumble over investigation into Huang's affair with alleged Chinese spy</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6zxjx01vyleo#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T19:58:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6zxjx01vyleo--c4bc507025bd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6zxjx01vyleo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The share price dropped wiped hundreds of billions of dollars from the value of Nvidia.</summary></entry><entry><title>Who is the suspected Chinese spy at centre of the Nvidia investigation?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c80404zyr53wo#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T14:50:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c80404zyr53wo--73882470a9b3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c80404zyr53wo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Alice Huang, a Chinese businesswoman, had a close relationship with Nvidia boss Jensen Huang, reports say.</summary></entry><entry><title>Government 'looking seriously' at banning under-16s from Vinted and eBay</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmzxjvpqrjxro#0</id><updated>2026-11-11T16:22:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T15:37:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmzxjvpqrjxro--1fd2c4b355c2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmzxjvpqrjxro?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The culture secretary confirms reports they could be in the list of platforms set to be banned next March.</summary></entry><entry><title>Can the Zelda remake capture 